  <content>
  <note class="self-check"><title>Self Check</title>
<para>Given the table below, what would be the next term in the sequence?</para>
<table class="os-raise-horizontaltable">
  <tgroup cols="6"><tbody><row>
      <entry><emphasis>
        \(x\)
     </emphasis> </entry><entry>
        1
      </entry>
      <entry>
        2
      </entry>
      <entry>
        3
      </entry>
      <entry>
        4
      </entry>
      <entry>
        5
      </entry>
    </row>
    <row>
      <entry><emphasis>
        \(y\)
     </emphasis> </entry><entry>
        270
      </entry>
      <entry>
        90
      </entry>
      <entry>
        30
      </entry>
      <entry>
        10
      </entry>
      <entry>
        \(\frac{10}3\)
      </entry>
    </row>
  </tbody></tgroup></table></note>
</content>
</document>